{"availability":"available","full":"anandsah-codes/market-analytics-dashboard","name":"market-analytics-dashboard","description":"React market analytics dashboard with demo market data, risk monitoring, relative-strength analysis, and options analytics.","category":"Finance","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-31T07:49:57Z","updated":"2026-09-01T17:07:16Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://anandsah-codes.github.io/market-analytics-dashboard/","topics":["javascript","market-analysis","quantitative-finance","react","risk-management"],"demo":"https://anandsah-codes.github.io/market-analytics-dashboard/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:40:06.851Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T22:40:06.851Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T22:40:06.851Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T22:40:06.851Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A browser-based equity market analytics dashboard. It classifies the market environment, ranks symbols by relative strength, resamples price history across timeframes, scores technical setups against a transparent factor model, sizes positions from a risk budget, and prices options with Black-Scholes.","It runs entirely on synthetic data generated in the browser. Clone it, install, and it works — no API keys, no accounts, no configuration.","I kept writing the same analytics by hand — moving-average structure, ATR distance, relative strength, position size — and wanted them in one place with the reasoning visible rather than buried in a spreadsheet."],"features":["Market regime classification. Reads breadth across 11 sector ETFs, benchmark trend structure, realised volatility, and defensive-versus-cyclical leadership, then classifies the environment as Risk-On, Constructive,…","Relative strength ranking. Ranks symbols by weighted excess return over a benchmark across 5, 20 and 60-day lookbacks (0.20 / 0.45 / 0.35). Missing lookbacks are dropped and the remaining weights renormalised, so short…","Multi-timeframe analysis. Daily bars are resampled into weekly and monthly buckets rather than fetched separately. Trend direction is compared across timeframes and flagged when they disagree.","Setup scoring. A five-factor weighted model summing to 100: trend structure (25), distance from the mean in ATRs (20), momentum (20), volume confirmation (15) and relative strength (20). Graded A+ through F, with the…","Earnings awareness. Flags symbols reporting within five days and applies a score penalty, with a specific warning for long options about implied-volatility crush — a position can be right on direction through an…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/anandsah-codes/market-analytics-dashboard/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7052ffe357feb4f99537b47fab1a7b70e45fcbb78ee168fbaa8e9a7f9871b05a","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T22:40:07.041Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:40:07.041Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A browser-based equity market analytics dashboard. It classifies the market environment, ranks symbols by relative strength, resamples price history across timeframes, scores technical setups against a transparent factor model, sizes positions from a risk budget, and prices options with Black-Scholes.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/anandsah-codes/market-analytics-dashboard/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"Clone it, install, and it works — no API keys, no accounts, no configuration.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/anandsah-codes/market-analytics-dashboard/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"7052ffe357feb4f99537b47fab1a7b70e45fcbb78ee168fbaa8e9a7f9871b05a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/anandsah-codes/market-analytics-dashboard/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:40:07.042Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-01T17:07:16Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"